#: ../../tools/survival_tools.rst:117 f5a7812050fe4c4b902e3b1fbdfaab05
msgid ""
"**Description**: Perform Mantel-Cox log-rank test to compare survival "
"between two groups. Tests null hypothesis that survival curves are "
"identical. Returns chi-squared statistic, p-value, observed vs expected "
"events per group. A p-value < 0.05 indicates statistically significant "
"difference in survival. Use for: comparing treatment arms, high vs low "
"expression groups."
msgstr ""

